#: scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b253619e93183aeef65a6782844a7c9830cbf88a58dab43680707e9899711dc
