#: scenario7:scenario7_C868D4F1_2DC3_4B08_B4FB_216653ABEDDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 929b0cc0c01a6f71b4b4dca1edf9a9512e1ed4399983407e9a779c7244df9545
