#: scenario7:scenario7_34F17C4C_ACA6_4B21_B395_658CB898BFE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdbdc43139be43f08d0574d08b082d04b01dbc7c706956b2dd205bba5d018a94
