msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_34F17C4C_ACA6_4B21_B395_658CB898BFE3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can think of one other reason she was able to escape."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……肯定……⟪k:1⟫不仅如此。⟪k:2⟫是有理由的。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫那个理由才是我们的力量——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA8BDA13_A7CB_4863_9F21_F72781AF6E5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a618f6c711527cd5f9e154573fc72218c8c088f3bb3534b3e9cc29c06c29c67
