msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it’s the only way we’ll be able to find the power we need to cast off the darkness of "
"this house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫也是解放黑暗的唯一方法。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_69FDA528_F279_4D7B_93C3_EE3E12A62196
