"⟪k:0⟫Whatever nonsense that woman filled your head with,⟪k:1⟫it certainly seems to have put some "
"fight into those eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不知道她给你灌输了什么想法……⟪k:1⟫你的神情镇定不少啊。⟪k:2⟫需要女人来安慰，⟪k:3⟫你真是太软弱"
"了。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5E250B83_3019_4707_A6F5_7B56EC625D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bf25f38bf246446acdeaed68cd003d36f6ee64d085c533606c20fa60053bb77
