#: scenario7:scenario7_D3387E17_242B_4891_9DEB_F2FA0A2444A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e97d5ee01e6c2905f78ba2263a8006e840ec8458d1b433bce283cf1c0dd36a2c
